message: "If you use SpectraViewer in your work, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "SpectraViewer"
version: "1.2.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.20715098"
date-released: 2026-11-17
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Hidasi"
    given-names: "Zsolt"
abstract: >-
  SpectraViewer is a lightweight spectrum browser for quickly opening,
  viewing, and browsing supported spectrum files, including OPUS native
  spectrum files, JCAMP-DX files, and DPT data point tables. It also
  supports exporting spectra as JCAMP-DX files. It is intended for fast
  visual inspection and navigation through spectrum collections,
  not for spectral processing or data manipulation.
keywords:
  - Spectroscopy
  - Spectrum viewer
  - FTIR
  - Bruker OPUS
  - JCAMP-DX
  - DPT
  - Infrared spectroscopy
  - Spectral data
  - Scientific software
license: MIT
